  "title": "cCell Palm Pro 510 Battery",
  "description": "CCELL®\nPalm Pro 510 Battery\n\nFrom setup to use, Palm Pro provides the ultimate user-friendly experience. Simply drop the cartridge into the battery, adjust your preferences, and draw. Multiple voltage settings and an intuitive airflow collar allow the Palm Pro to control the suction resistance simply by adjusting the size of the gap, and the preheating function delivers delicious flavours and rich clouds from the first puff, even in cold weather.\n\nProduct Features:\n– Battery Capacity: 500mAh\n– Dimensions: 2.26H x 1.65W x 0.53D (in) / 57.5H x 42W x 13.55D (mm)\n– Standard 510 thread\n– 10-second preheat\n– 3 voltage settings (2.8/3.2/3.6V)\n– Adjustable airflow\n– 3-bar battery status LED\n– Drop-in magnetic connection\n– Inhale activated\n– Type-C charging\n\nWhat’s Included:\n1 x Palm Pro 510 Battery",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>CCELL®</strong><br /><strong>Palm Pro 510 Battery</strong></p>\n<p>From setup to use, Palm Pro provides the ultimate user-friendly experience. Simply drop the cartridge into the battery, adjust your preferences, and draw. Multiple voltage settings and an intuitive airflow collar allow the Palm Pro to control the suction resistance simply by adjusting the size of the gap, and the preheating function delivers delicious flavours and rich clouds from the first puff, even in cold weather.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong><br />&#8211; Battery Capacity: 500mAh<br />&#8211; Dimensions: 2.26H x 1.65W x 0.53D (in) / 57.5H x 42W x 13.55D (mm)<br />&#8211; Standard 510 thread<br />&#8211; 10-second preheat<br />&#8211; 3 voltage settings (2.8/3.2/3.6V)<br />&#8211; Adjustable airflow<br />&#8211; 3-bar battery status LED<br />&#8211; Drop-in magnetic connection<br />&#8211; Inhale activated<br />&#8211; Type-C charging</p>\n<p>What&#8217;s Included:<br />1 x Palm Pro 510 Battery</p>",
